{"level":"info","time":"2026-10-11T12:14:57.541Z","service":"overlay:child-live-298","logDomain":"non-session","data":{"at":149362,"facts":{"sessionID":"ses_hiMeFBUS0P1I5RrYejzV","sequence":538,"epoch":1791720517999,"changed":[{"messageID":"msg_g0VXk6FOn006VNhhPZPT","partID":"prt_g0VXk6GMg00lA23U5pJE","text":"## 一、阅读范围与证据边界\n\n本次仅由我一名只读研究员使用 `webfetch` 读取指定三篇文章，未搜索、读取本地文件或发布产物。W3C 原地址返回 404，改用同篇文章的 [focus-order.html](https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/focus-order.html) 成功读取；MDN 指针事件页截断的是正文之后的导航，相关正文已获取。\n\n**文档事实**：三页分别说明尺寸通知、指针事件目标与焦点顺序，并非完整的聊天界面规范。**设计建议**：下文把这些机制用于长对话，但自动滚动、来源面板和流式更新策略都是应用层选择，不能冒充文档规定。\n\n## 二、流式正文：观察尺寸，不是观察每个字\n\n**文档事实**：[ResizeObserver 开篇及 Examples](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ResizeObserver#","displayed":"## 一、阅读范围与证据边界\n\n本次仅由我一名只读研究员使用 `webfetch` 读取指定三篇文章，未搜索、读取本地文件或发布产物。W3C 原地址返回 404，改用同篇文章的 [focus-order.html](https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/focus-order.html) 成功读取；MDN 指针事件页截断的是正文之后的导航，相关正文已获取。\n\n**文档事实**：三页分别说明尺寸通知、指针事件目标与焦点顺序，并非完整的聊天界面规范。**设计建议**：下文把这些机制用于长对话，但自动滚动、来源面板和流式更新策略都是应用层选择，不能冒充文档规定。\n\n## 二、流式正文：观察尺寸，不是观察每个字\n\n**文档事实**：[ResizeObserver 开篇及 Examples](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ResizeObserver#examples) "}],"regressions":[],"recentEvents":[{"type":"message.part.delta","sequence":527,"epoch":1791720517999,"messageID":"msg_g0VXk6FOn006VNhhPZPT","partID":"prt_g0VXk6GMg00lA23U5pJE","deltaLength":3},{"type":"message.part.delta","sequence":528,"epoch":1791720517999,"messageID":"msg_g0VXk6FOn006VNhhPZPT","partID":"prt_g0VXk6GMg00lA23U5pJE","deltaLength":5},{"type":"message.part.delta","sequence":529,"epoch":1791720517999,"messageID":"msg_g0VXk6FOn006VNhhPZPT","partID":"prt_g0VXk6GMg00lA23U5pJE","deltaLength":4},{"type":"message.part.delta","sequence":530,"epoch":1791720517999,"messageID":"msg_g0VXk6FOn006VNhhPZPT","partID":"prt_g0VXk6GMg00lA23U5pJE","deltaLength":4},{"type":"message.part.delta","sequence":531,"epoch":1791720517999,"messageID":"msg_g0VXk6FOn006VNhhPZPT","par